# L §8.2 `pinned:` row (round 11b): "Pins formed per binding tuple print once, as written, with their binding
# (`pinned: gross = g for g in gross_lo .. gross_hi step minor(DUK)`), never one line per tuple". The pin {gross = g}
# is formed once per g of the max's binding.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input gross: money PLN
input gross_lo: money PLN
input gross_hi: money PLN
input rate_: num

def net: money PLN
  rule r = round(gross * rate_, minor(PLN), half-up)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  gross = 100 PLN "s"
  gross_lo = 100 PLN "s"
  gross_hi = 100.02 PLN "s"
  rate_ = 0.5 "s"

ask q: max(net as if {gross = g} for g in gross_lo .. gross_hi step minor(PLN))
=== expect
q: ...
  pinned: gross = g for g in gross_lo .. gross_hi step minor(PLN)
  cut 2026-12-31
